    "updated_at": "2016-09-14T11:46:49Z",
    "body": "PR to fix the test at https://github.com/w3c/web-platform-tests/pull/3640\n\nPrevious discussion https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/1026 (`ping` was DOMTokenList in the spec for some time, but not implemented).\n\nIt would be possible to change the spec again to match Gecko. Opinions @ayg @bzbarsky ? I think `ping` is the only attribute that has a space-separated list of URLs. `srcset` reflects as a string.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
