    "updated_at": "2016-09-15T18:04:31Z",
    "body": "Test at http://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/?saved=4474. Blink also reflects as a string. Edge does not implement `.ping`.\n\nI don't feel strongly either way. This is a weird one.\n",
