    "created_at": "2016-10-25T12:17:29Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-25T12:17:29Z",
    "body": "I don't have a strong opinion.  If no one else does either, it would be easier for Gecko to switch to WebKit/Blink behavior than the reverse, so let's do that.\n",
